abstract: >
  CubeScope is a browser-native, local-first, hardware-accelerated viewer kernel
  for ENVI hyperspectral datasets, built around Rust/WASM, workers, and WebGPU.
keywords:
  - hyperspectral imaging
  - ENVI
  - WebGPU
  - WebAssembly
  - scientific software
